# Portfolio

Grid data lives in `_data/portfolio.yml`. Case studies are `portfolio/<slug>/index.html`. Follow skill `add-portfolio-item`.

Categories must be one or more of: `category-web`, `category-design`, `category-apps` (space-separated if combined).

- Add a new YAML item **and** a matching folder page. Do not add only one of them.
- Copy an existing case study (`portfolio/start-cms/index.html`) instead of simplifying the Elementor markup.
- `link` in YAML is a site-relative path such as `portfolio/start-cms/` (no leading slash). Images in YAML do not use a leading slash; posts do.
